d the on-call engineer. The summary covers the rollback, the error rate before and after, and that v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until its failure is root-caused.\n\nThe follow-up is to investigate why v2.3.1 failed. v2.3.1-rc also failed in staging.", "type": "text"}]}]}